  "name": "IP Radar — Self-hosted IP threat intel enrichment",
  "description": "Enrich messages with a fused, multi-source IP threat verdict (verdict/confidence/types) plus country and ASN from a self-hosted IP Radar instance (https://github.com/steponeerror/ip-radar). Includes 3 lookup data adapters (HTTP JSONPath), 3 lookup tables, 2 pipeline rules, and a pipeline bound to the default stream. Requires IP Radar running locally on http://127.0.0.1:8000 — see integrations/graylog/README.md in the IP Radar repo. On Graylog >= 5.1 allowlist the adapter URLs first: System -> Lookup Tables -> Allowlist.",
  "id": "32fa565d-e9bb-4d88-9919-abfb7859b2dd",
